SUMMARY:ho99o9\, N8 NoFace\, slay squad
LOCATION:Garden Amphitheatre\, Garden Grove
DESCRIPTION:Ho99o9 (pronounced Horror) is an American punk rap duo founded 
 
in 2012 in Newark\, New Jersey\, by theOGM and Yeti Bones (also known as Ea
 
ddy). They have released multiple EPs\, accompanied by grindhouse-style mus
 
ic videos\, and three full-length albums\, United States of Horror (2017)\,
 
 SKIN (2022) and Tomorrow We Escape (2025). N8NOFACE is a Tucson\, Arizona-
 
-raised musician and rapper now based in Long Beach\, California\, known fo
 
r blending gritty punk with lo‑fi hip‑hop into a dark\, personal\, and 
 
often surreal sound Slay Squad formed in 2013\, initially starting as a hip
 
-hop group before evolving into a rap metal collective. Their music blends 
 
rap\, metal\, and hip-hop\, a style they describe as "ghetto metal\," refle
 
cting both aggressive energy and underground influences. Tickets & info: ht
 
tps://www.ticketweb.com/event/ho99o9-n8-noface-slay-squad-garden-amphitheat
 
re-tickets/14216754
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/ho99o9-n8-noface-slay-squad-garden-amph
 
itheatre-tickets/14216754
