SUMMARY:Argentine Film Festival Supported by The Miracle Theater Foundation
LOCATION:The Miracle Theater\, Inglewood
DESCRIPTION:Friday 23rd 7:30pm LA VIRGEN DE LA TOSQUERA Argentina. 93m. Dir
 
 Laura Casabé On the eve of the 2001 outbreak\, Natalia falls madly in lov
 
e with her lifelong friend Diego. The romance is interrupted when he meets 
 
the more experienced Silvia. With the help of her grandma Rita\, Natalia de
 
cides to call on incantations and curses to jinx Diego and Silvia's blossom
 
ing relationship. En vísperas del estallido social de 2001\, Natalia se en
 
amora perdidamente de Diego\, su amigo de toda la vida. El romance se ve in
 
